204
00:18:24.842 --> 00:18:26.741
Platform Quality Guild, Reviewers:

205
00:18:27.021 --> 00:18:28.770
Service leads, SRE.

206
00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:34.959
Context, 26 services, shared datastores, an event bus, and mobile or partner clients.

207
00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:42.450
A quarter of green pipeline outages (rounding bug, contract break, stale read) showed coverage is not correctness.

208
00:18:42.730 --> 00:19:03.082
Decision, Adopt the pyramid with a strong contract layer; mandate property-based tests for money or serialization or idempotency logic; integration tests against real dependencies for every repository or adapter; linearizability or Jepsen-style checks for any component claiming strong consistency;

209
00:19:03.362 --> 00:19:07.437
and mutation testing as the quality gate instead of a coverage number.

