00:27:08.231 --> 00:27:14.951
Consumer-driven contract: the checkout consumer needs cartid:number. totalpaise:number, currency:string.

287
00:27:15.231 --> 00:27:21.844
We verify each provider version against that contract, with NO consumer running, just. the published contract.

288
00:27:22.124 --> 00:27:24.321
Contract (published by the consumer):

289
00:27:24.601 --> 00:27:33.924
GET or cart or 42 must return totalpaise=number. cartid=number, currency=string. provider v1 (original):

