655
00:55:31.217 --> 00:55:36.145
Introduce a bug (drop trailing zeros) and confirm the tester finds and shrinks it.

656
00:55:36.425 --> 00:55:41.033
(B2) Define a consumer-driven contract for an endpoint your service calls.

657
00:55:41.313 --> 00:55:47.926
Break the provider (rename a field) and watch verification fail; then evolve it additively and watch it pass.

658
00:55:48.206 --> 00:55:59.107
(B3) Take L4's integration test and add a fault-injection case for a statement timeout (a slow query hitting statementtimeout); assert the app surfaces it and rolls back.

659
00:56:00.457 --> 00:56:12.511
(B3) Extend L3's checker to a read or write register with a CAS operation, and construct a history that's linearizable for a correct CAS but not for a broken one.

660
00:56:12.791 --> 00:56:19.937
(B4) Design the CI pipeline for §1.1's service so all three incidents would have been caught pre-merge.

